  unitName: Baiken (Omni)
  unitId: 830388
  unitNumber: 8354
  description: A swordswoman from another world, her skill with the blade is the
    stuff of legends. Her arrival at the new world was nothing new to her - while
    the monsters looked different, they acted the same for the most part. And, more
    importantly, they bled and died the same way. When she heard that others from
    her universe had come to this strange land, she decided to investigate the matter
    further for herself and see what advantage she could gain. Every edge she could
    gain counted in her quest for revenge, and she planned to make the most of it
    with the target of her quest...
  summonDesc: Winning and losing doesn't mean a thing. I'll survive, and I'll keep
    fighting. Count on it.
  fusionDesc: I don't care what you think about my strength. Just point me to where
    I need to go. I'll handle the rest.
  evoDesc: That's not a bad weapon, but you're a lousy soldier. Hey, eyes up here.
  element: 3
  rarity: 7
